-| 🌐 Web | Playwright | Java | TestNG / JUnit5 | Allure |
-| 🌐 Web | Playwright | Python | Pytest | pytest-html, Allure |
-| 🌐 Web | Selenium | Java | TestNG | Allure, ExtentReports |
